      "content": "hold on, why are you comparing bacteria to goblins and underground settlements? i'm trying to write a serious safety manual for professional kitchen staff, not a storybook. please stop with the metaphors and just give me the actual biological/microscopic details of how the germination and toxin production works if we miss the windows.",
